<title>UK: Sparbanken Vest sets $50 million 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Sparbanken Vest sets $50 million 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Chase Manhattan International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SPARBANKEN VEST</p>
<p> AMT    $50 MLN	 BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY	 DEC.06</p>
<p> TYPE   STEP-UP FRN   MARGIN     *70 BP    PAY DATE    13.DEC.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  99.50     FULL FEES   65 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	*TO YEAR FIVE, 145 BP THEREAFTER</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 10-100    SALE LIMITS US/UK/NO</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> NOTES	CALLABLE AT PAR IN DECEMBER 2001</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
